  "prefLabel": "He-C 502.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 502.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to define the following entities that may register to operate a syringe services program in New Hampshire to prevent the transmission of disease and reduce morbidity and mortality among individuals who inject drugs, and those individuals' contacts.\n\nSource. #12624, eff 9-26-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c500.html"
